 "title": "Supplemental material: The silent hunters of spiders: discovering a new Gibellula (Ascomycota: Cordycipitaceae) fungus in the Brazilian Atlantic Forest",
 "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/18809393",
 "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18809393",
 "description": "<p>This dataset is a supplemental part of the manuscript \"<strong>The silent hunters of spiders: discovering a new <em>Gibellula </em>(Ascomycota: Cordycipitaceae) fungus in the Brazilian Atlantic Forest</strong>\", by Aline dos Santos, Thairine Mendes Pereira, Camila de F&aacute;tima Ferreira Ribeiro and Thiago Gechel Kloss, submitted to Fungal Biology (2026).&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We have included the raw measurements of fungal structures, body size, and tarsus-metatarsus length, along with the R scripts for statistical analyses, final concatenated alignment and raw phylogenetic consensus trees (maximum likelihood and bayesian inference analyses).</p>",
